---
import Section from '@/components/ui/Section.astro';
import Icon from '@/components/ui/Icon.astro';
---
<Section pad="md">
  <div
    data-reveal
    class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] bg-paper px-6 py-12 ring-1 ring-navy/[0.06] sm:px-12 sm:py-14"
  >
    <div
      class="halo pointer-events-none absolute -right-16 -top-16 size-56 rounded-full bg-coral/15"
      aria-hidden="true"
    >
    </div>

    <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-2xl">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <span
          class="grid size-10 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-coral/[0.14]"
          aria-hidden="true"
        >
          <Icon name="heart" size={19} class="text-coral-deep" />
        </span>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-navy sm:text-[1.9rem]">
          A note on how we price
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-5 space-y-4 text-[1.03rem] leading-relaxed text-navy-soft">
        <p>
          We've used family apps. Most stuff the features you actually want
          behind surprise paywalls, sell your attention, or quietly harvest
          more than they need. We didn't want to build that.
        </p>
        <p>
          Hubbly is one small subscription for your whole household - every
          feature, every device, no feature-gating games. It keeps the lights
          on, pays for the syncing and the servers, and means the product only
          wins when your family genuinely wants to keep it. The little theme
          packs are optional treats, never keys to features.
        </p>
        <p class="font-display text-lg font-semibold text-navy">
          No ads. No data sold. No paywalled basics. No pressure on kids - ever.
        </p>
      </div>

      <p class="mt-7 font-display text-lg font-semibold text-coral-deep">
        With <span class="text-coral">♥</span> from Hubbly
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Section>
